WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.191
Week 33: History, Society, and Multiple Perspectives. summarize a historical development distinguish fact from interpretation compare perspectives

2
00:00:10.191 --> 00:00:36.716
Read for the situation. Dos fuentes describen la misma protesta. El periódico destaca el cambio político, mientras un testimonio recuerda el miedo cotidiano. Ambas perspectivas aportan datos distintos. Two sources describe the same protest. The newspaper emphasizes the political change, while a testimony recalls the everyday fear. Both perspectives contribute different facts.

3
00:00:36.716 --> 00:00:45.478
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:51.232
Reading activities. Reading activity 79; Reading activity 80

5
00:00:51.232 --> 00:00:59.226
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:37.537
Model language. La fuente afirma que la reforma amplió derechos. — The source states that the reform expanded rights. Otros sostienen que la desigualdad continuó. — Others maintain that inequality continued. Cuando cambió el gobierno, muchas personas ya habían emigrado. — When the government changed, many people had already emigrated. Aunque existe consenso sobre los hechos, su significado se debate. — Although there is consensus about the facts, their meaning is debated. El testimonio aporta una perspectiva personal. — The testimony provides a personal perspective.

7
00:01:37.537 --> 00:01:47.691
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
